I'd be more interested in enchanting the helm and gloves up. After
all, a normal soldier's helmet gives the same AC bonus as does an
orcish helm (although it's more stylish!  :-). So if you don't find a
HoB or dwarvish helm or something else that would be especially
useful, I'd just enhance what I have. Same with gauntlets. Check the
Castle for GoP or GoDex (although at high experience levels GoDex are
pretty much redundant); other than that, your basic leather works as
well as anything else.

Others have said that your AC is good enough for Gehennom, which is
true, but you'll probably have little chance to improve it while in
Gehennom, which means you need to be thinking ahead to Ascension Run
AC now. Also, if you don't have to depend on the ring for 3 pts of AC,
you can wear something else in that slot, if needed.
